WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.840
I built SKYNET to bring trading intelligence

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.290
and execution into one platform.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.130
It tracks Telegram signals and on-chain wallet activity,

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.030
with rankings that make their historical performance easier to compare.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.810
Wallet profiles reveal trading results and behavior,

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.590
while market intelligence adds context about changing conditions.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.880
The strategy engine lets you replay historical signals

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.770
with different exit rules and position sizes.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.670
The trading terminal brings together Phantom wallet swaps,

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.580
automated copy trading through my custom Rust engine,

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.810
and live position monitoring.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.080
Detailed transaction timelines show the journey

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.590
from the source signal through execution to on-chain confirmation.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.680
SKYNET connects the research, the trade,

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.630
and the evidence behind it.
